      "widgets_values": [
        "## What the Dial does\n\n- **Amount 0**: Helm is off\n- **Amount 1**: the strongest setting that still looks right for this idea\n- **Before** = your prompt, Dial off. **After** = same prompt and seed, your Amount\n\nOnly the picture changes along one idea. Your prompt is not rewritten.\n\nThe video renders twice (Before and After), so it takes about twice as long."
      ],
      "title": "Note: What the Dial does",
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
